\is1 Psalms
\ip Brenton numbers the psalms as the Greek does.
{psalm numbers}
\ip He counts a psalm’s title as its first verse, or its first two. In these psalms every verse after the title is so many lower in the King James Bible, so that {PSA 33:13-17} is its {kjv bare PSA 33:13-17}.
{psalm verses}
\ip In these the verses differ by no one number.
{psalm rows}
